WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
A reaction has finished, and
your product is in the flask.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.580
But so is everything else:
leftover starting material,

3
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.580
acid and water, all in one cloudy mix.

4
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.020
Chemists need that product pure.

5
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.940
A pure solid melts sharply,
at its data-book value.

6
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.580
So how do chemists get the product out
of that cloudy mix, and make it pure?

7
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.240
In this mission, you'll set up glassware
to heat under reflux and to distil,

8
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.580
and decide when to use each.

9
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:34.640
Then you'll wash, dry and purify a
solid by letting fresh crystals form,

10
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.880
and use its melting point
to test its purity.

11
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.480
Your mission: work out how to
get the product out pure.